 "narrative": "## The trajectory\nRevenue was $5.9B in FY2025 [1].\nRevenue CAGR was +34.8% over FY2016..FY2025 [2].\nNet income was -$460.5M in FY2025 [3].\n\n## Growth quality\nRevenue growth in FY2025 was +10.6% [1] [4].\nNet income growth in FY2025 was +34.0% [3] [5].\nIn FY2025, net income growth of +34.0% [3] [5] was above revenue growth of +10.6% [1] [4].\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow growth of +58.7% [6] [7] was above net income growth of +34.0% [3] [5].\n\n## Margins\nOperating margin was -9.0% in FY2025 [8].\nOperating margin changed +5.7pp in FY2025 [8] [9].\nNet margin was -7.8% in FY2025 [10].\n\n## Cash & balance sheet\nIn FY2025, free cash flow of $437.2M [11] was above net income of -$460.5M [3].\nThe current ratio was 3.56\u00d7 in FY2025 [12], above 1.00\u00d7.\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow of $656.2M [6] was above net income of -$460.5M [3].\n\n## Red flags\nLong-term debt grew +54.9% from FY2021 to FY2025. Source operands: Long-term debt USD 2,253,087,000 in FY2021 [13]; Long-term debt USD 3,489,860,000 in FY2025 [14].\n\n## What to watch next\nWatch whether revenue growth in the next reporting update improves from +10.6% in FY2025 [1] [4].\nWatch how net income in the next reporting update compares with -$460.5M in FY2025 [3].\nWatch how operating margin in the next reporting update compares with -9.0% in FY2025 [8].\nWatch how free cash flow in the next reporting update compares with $437.2M in FY2025 [11].",
